  "id": "mcp-host/a-content-the-model-is-not-shown-reads-as-a-note-of-its-kind-and-type",
  "title": "A tool result's image, audio, blob resource and resource link each read as a one-line note naming its kind and media type: the type kept to the characters a media type has, at most 64, and for a type the server did not name image/png, audio, binary or unknown",
  "rules": [
    "§21.2"
  ],
  "requirements": [
    "RK-21.2-051"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: tools/_mcp_result.py _text_of and _note (_MEDIA_TYPE_CHARS, _MEDIA_TYPE_LIMIT); roomkit-rs: roomkit-mcp results.rs. The public text-returning call_tool reads every non-text content as its note, an image of a type the model takes included. Each call's result holds one content, so the note is the call's whole text. An image or an audio whose server named no type sends an empty mimeType, which the protocol requires. The note's words are the reference's, which the unit quotes. Not observed: a kind of content the protocol does not define, which the client refuses before the note is written.",
